/-!
# Operations and holomorphic comparisons for genuine line bundles

The variable scalar-cocycle bundles here are the existing
`HolomorphicCharacterBundle.TransitionData.core` bundles. The supporting
files construct duals, tensor products on intersection covers, pullbacks
along holomorphic maps, and genuine fibrewise-linear biholomorphisms from
compatible local holomorphic gauges. Their fibre identifications and
coordinate formulas refer to the original bundle topologies and atlases.
-/
